 "rules": [
  "Mazda headlamp numbers: XXXX-51-0YY + letter revision. Prefix XXXX = model/variant (e.g. KL2J vs KL2L), 51 = lighting group.",
  "Side: 030/031 = RIGHT, 040/041 = LEFT (Mazda TSB MC-11021392: ****-51-030*/040* for CX-30, MX-5, CX-70, CX-90; ****-51-031*/041* for CX-5). 0K0 = RIGHT, 0L0 = LEFT (CX-9 without AFS, Mazda3 halogen).",
  "The number printed on the lamp label is often the production one without revision (e.g. KPF1-51030, KSD6-51030); the service number has a revision letter (KPF1-51-031D). Both are the same lamp.",
  "AFS / adaptive is NOT encoded by 030 vs 031 — it is encoded by the PREFIX (CX-5 KF: KL2J = without AFS, KL2L = with AFS; CX-5 22-25: KPF1 = without, KPF3 = with).",
  "Номер виду XXXX-67-890 на етикетці — це блок керування/драйвер LED (ballast), а не номер фари (напр. BGDN-67890, DGH9-67-890). У картці як основний парт-номер його не використовувати."
 ],
